---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Life in China - China Starter Guide" lang="en">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Daily Life in China</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600  ">
      What to expect in daily life — SIM cards, food, housing, and staying connected.
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-8">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50  :border-gray-800">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">SIM Card & eSIM</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600  ">
          China Unicom, China Mobile, and Airalo eSIM — what works and what doesn't.
        </p>
        <span class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium">Coming soon</span>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50  :border-gray-800">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Food & Dining</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600  ">
          How to order, what's safe to eat, tipping culture, and paying the bill.
        </p>
        <span class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium">Coming soon</span>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50  :border-gray-800">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Internet & VPN</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600  ">
          What's blocked, how to access Google/WhatsApp, and legal VPN options.
        </p>
        <span class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium">Coming soon</span>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50  :border-gray-800">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Accommodation</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600  ">
          Hotels vs Airbnb, what to expect at check-in, and deposit rules.
        </p>
        <span class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium">Coming soon</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>